TION\n\nGet busted, serve your time, and jump back into the schoolyard to cause chaos again.\n\n# BECOME THE BIGGEST TROUBLEMAKER\n\nRaise your status, create funny moments, hang out with friends, and become the player everyone remembers.\n\nCause trouble. Get noticed. Escape seniors. Avoid detention.\n", "short_description": "\ud83d\udc12 Monkey school chaos in VR\n\ud83c\udf4c Prank. Run. Escape DETENTION!\n\nMOST IMPORTANTLY, build your reputation as the biggest troublemaker in school..."}]}, "developer_name": "AshRift Studios", "developer_privacy_policy_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/detention-monkeys/home", "developer_terms_of_service_url": null, "publisher_name": "AshRift Studios", "support_website_url": null, "website_url": "https://sites.google.com/view/detention-monkeys-vr/home", "category": null, "comfort_rating": "COMFORTABLE_FOR_SOME", "comfort_tags": [], "context_category": {"id": "2743326035925534", "context_category": "GAMES"}, "context_topics": [{"id": "459781504968480"}, {"id": "1023770785722696"}, {"id": "2691890164460465"}, {"id": "528142316460358"}], "external_subscription_type": "NOT_REQUIRED", "genres": [], "has_in_app_ads": null, "internet_connection": "REQUIRED", "play_area": "MOVEMENT", "recommended_graphics": null, "recommended_memory_gb": null, "recommended_processor": null, "supported_in_app_languages": ["en"], "supported_input_devices": ["OCULUS_TOUCH"], "supported_player_modes": ["STANDING", "ROOM_SCALE"], "supported_tracking_modes": [], "user_interaction_modes": ["MULTI_USER", "MULTI_USER"], "id": "27067625749573606"}}]}, "scheduled_offers": {"count": 1, "nodes": [{"status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1945099799525543"}]}, "baseline_offer": {"id": "1945099799525543"}, "is_approved": true, "firstOffer": {"nodes": [{"start_time": 1783017240, "status": "PUBLISHED", "id": "1945099799525543"}]}, "liveChannel": {"nodes": [{"latest_supported_binary": {"__typename": "AndroidBinary", "binary_test_results": {"nodes": []}, "id": "28817379414598222